  "details": "The SDK is only reporting 198 cloth vertices (which is correct, as I made sure to stay under 200 to avoid Very Poor), but the in-game stat shows 272, and it's making my avatar Very Poor rated. \n\nThe avatar ID in question is avtr_4584441f-5ce6-44be-ba93-8e63572a5e67",
